Voice audit fixes: smart brain, voice picker, mute/wake/silence bugs

Server (voice_llm.py, verified via curl):
- silence guard: empty/punctuation/filler input returns EMPTY so TTS stays
  silent (kills the talks-non-stop-on-silence loop)
- model kimi-k2.6:cloud + think:false (gpt-oss leaked reasoning + ignored
  memory; kimi is smart, clean, knows Boss); num_predict cap
- rich Boss profile in boss-core-memory (was 6 lines) -> knows who he is
- /v1/voice/set-voice endpoint (PATCHes the EL agent voice)

App (builds green):
- mute-freeze fix: throttle audioLevel 100Hz -> ~14Hz (recomposition storm
  was freezing taps); lighter core during calls (440 particles)
- wake fix: resume listening after a call OR error (treated error as
  in-call and died); fresh mic + stream each session; back off if mic busy
- voice picker: VoiceCatalog (8 voices) + SetVoiceClient + dropdown in the
  voice top bar -> choose PAGEL's voice (applies next session)

